m/users/RealIceCone/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RealIceCone/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RealIceCone/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RealIceCone/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RealIceCone/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RealIceCone/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-05T20:06:08Z","updated_at":"2026-08-05T20:06:08Z","body":"> Official drivers are included out of box with the Linux kernel (since 6.12) and Mesa (since 24.3).\n\nSo where do i report the issue?","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5196759024/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5197099749","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/122127#issuecomment-5197099749","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122127","id":5197099749,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABNcVy5Q","user":{"login":"ominousllama","id":149961466,"node_id":"U_kgDOCPA6-g","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/149961466?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ominousllama","html_url":"https://github.com/ominousllama","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ominousllama/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ominousllama/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ominousllama/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ominousllama/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ominousllama/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ominousllama/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ominousllama/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ominousllama/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ominousllama/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-05T20:41:32Z","updated_at":"2026-08-05T20:41:32Z","body":"> So where do i report the issue?\n\nAparently directly to the [Mesa Issue tracker](https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/mesa/mesa/-/issues) (or at least thats what they say on https://github.com/IGCIT/Intel-GPU-Community-Issue-Tracker-IGCIT)","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5197099749/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5197372824","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/122127#issuecomment-5197372824","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122127","id":5197372824,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABNcmdmA","user":{"login":"ominousllama","id":149961466,"node_id":"U_kgDOCPA6-g","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/149961466?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ominousllama","html_url":"https://github.com/ominousllama","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ominousllama/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ominousllama/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ominousllama/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ominousllama/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ominousllama/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ominousllama/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ominousllama/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ominousllama/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ominousllama/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-05T21:08:08Z","updated_at":"2026-08-05T21:08:08Z","body":"Mesa 26.1.0 fixed an entry titled \"[BMG] regression: Artifacts in GTK applications in 26.0.x\" (https://docs.mesa3d.org/relnotes/26.1.0.html). Very close to what you are describin. Theres also corruption fixes in ANV generally, including a revert that resolved a B580 corruption plus a Battlemage scrambled video output bug on both XOrg and Wayland.\n\nCould you post your driver stack first? If you're on 26.0.x, updating Mesa may be the fix:\n\n```bash\nvulkaninfo --summary | grep -Ei 'driverInfo|driverName|deviceName'\nuname -r; lsmod | grep -E '^(xe|i915)'\n```\n\nIf thats not it, would you mind trying these steps to narrow it down if its actually another driver issue or Godot?\n\n1. Editor Settings -> Interface -> Editor -> Single Window Mode. Popups then render embedded instead of as native subwindows.\n2. Run Godot with `godot --rendering-driver opengl3`: If the compatibility renderer is ok, its the Vulkan path.\n3. `VK_DRIVER_FILES=/usr/share/vulkan/icd.d/lvp_icd.x86_64.json godot`: If software vilkan renders correctly the problem is ANV rather than Godot","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5197372824/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5204266857","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/122127#issuecomment-5204266857","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122127","id":5204266857,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABNjLPaQ","user":{"login":"RealIceCone","id":172186280,"node_id":"U_kgDOCkNaqA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubuser